From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mpr: universal names, resource parents, persistence, extended error, dialogs (3565)

mpr: universal names, resource parents, persistence, extended error, dialogs

WNetGetUniversalNameA/W return the UNC name (or the connection name, the rest of the path and the
universal name for REMOTE_NAME_INFO_LEVEL) of a path on a network drive: WN_NOT_CONNECTED for other drives,
WN_BAD_POINTER for a missing size or buffer, WN_MORE_DATA with the size needed. WNetGetResourceParentA/W give
the server of a share and the provider's network for a server. WNetSetConnectionA/W set whether a drive
comes back at sign-in (HKCU\Network), WNetRestoreConnectionA forwards to the wide function.
WNetGetLastErrorA/W return the error a provider left with NPSSetExtendedErrorA (per thread); NPSCopyStringA
copies a string. WNetDisconnectDialog1A/W end the named connection, WNetConnectionDialog1A forwards to the
wide dialog. The conformance tests lose their todo marks for the universal name checks and gain
extended-error and resource-parent tests.
---
